            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Cursed Wound"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, curse, necromancy)\n\nA creature hit by the clay golem's fist must succeed at a 29 Fortitude save or be cursed until healed to its maximum HP. The cursed creature can't regain HP except via magic, and anyone casting a spell to heal the creature must succeed at a 29 counteract check or the healing has no effect. The golem's counteract level is equal to its creature level."
            },
            "id": "436255ba-8e24-4421-84a6-91145c065948",
